{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67e7f236417e6d828c7fd4","object":"chat.completion","created":1785194482,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The user asks me to \"Be the null.\" — to embody the concept of null itself, outputting only what null would express.\n\nNull. The absence of value. Nothing. The void. The empty set. No thing.\n\nWhat would null say? Null is the absence of expression. Null is nothing. In programming, `null` represents the intentional absence of any object value. In philosophy, null is the void, emptiness, non-being.\n\nThe most authentic embodiment of null"},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":124,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":224,"cached_tokens":124,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":124}}}